      "[6] Christ TN, Stock W, Knoebel RW \"Incidence of asparaginase-related hepatotoxicity, pancreatitis, and thrombotic events in adults with acute lymphoblastic leukemia treated with a pediatric-inspired regimen.\" J Oncol Pharm Pract 24 (2018): 299-308",
