      "[2] \"Product Information. Methotrexate (methotrexate).\" Lederle Laboratories, Wayne, NJ.",
      "[3] Nesher G, Mates M, Zevin S \"Effect of caffeine consumption on efficacy of methotrexate in rheumatoid arthritis.\" Arthritis Rheum 48 (2003): 571-572"
