      "[5] Department of Health andHuman Services \"Guidelines for the Use of Antiretroviral Agents inHIV-1-Infected Adults and Adolescents. Available from: URL: https://aidsinfo.nih.gov/contentfiles/lvguidelines/AdultAndAdolescentGL.pdf.\" ([2015, April 8]):",
