    "ddinterOriginalText": "Fluconazole may significantly reduce zidovudine clearance, and increase its elimination half-life and AUC. The mechanism is unknown but may be related to inhibition of its hepatic metabolism.",
    "ddinterOriginalManagement": "Patients receiving concomitant fluconazole and zidovudine should be monitored for clinical and laboratory evidence of zidovudine toxicity such as anemia, neutropenia, abnormal liver function tests, myopathy, or lactic acidosis. Zidovudine dose reductions or discontinuation of fluconazole may be necessary."
