    "ddinterOriginalText": "Limited clinical data suggest that the concomitant use of zidovudine with nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory agents may increase the risk of hematological toxicity and/or bleeding in HIV-positive patients with hemophilia.",
    "ddinterOriginalManagement": "It is recommended to monitor patients for side effects and bleeding during concomitant use.",
