    "ddinterOriginalText": "Coadministration of zidovudine with other bone marrow depressive or cytotoxic agents may increase the risk and/or severity of zidovudine hematologic toxicity. Zidovudine has been associated with hematologic toxicities such as: neutropenia, granulocytopenia and severe anemia that required blood transfusions particularly in patients with advanced HIV disease.",
