    "ddinterOriginalText": "One study has suggested that zidovudine may have variable effects on plasma phenytoin levels. Increased levels, decreased levels, and no change have been reported. If zidovudine and phenytoin must be used together, close observation for altered clinical and laboratory effects is recommended.",
