      "[4] Hochster H, Dieterich D, Bozzette S, et al \"Toxicity of combined ganciclovir and zidovudine for cytomegalovirus disease associated with AIDS.\" Ann Intern Med 113 (1990): 111-7",
      "[5] Cimoch PJ, Lavelle J, Pollard R, et al. \"Pharmacokinetics of oral ganciclovir alone and in combination with zidovudine, didanosine, and probenecid in HIV-infected subjects.\" J Acquire Immune Defic Hum Retrovirol 17 (1998): 227-34",
      "[6] \"Product Information. Valcyte (valganciclovir)\" Roche Laboratories, Nutley, NJ.",
      "[7] Taburet AM, Singlas E \"Drug interactions with antiviral drugs.\" Clin Pharmacokinet 30 (1996): 385-401",
      "[8] Cerner Multum, Inc. \"UK Summary of Product Characteristics.\" O 0",
      "[9] \"Product Information. Valcyte (valganciclovir)\" Roche Laboratories, Nutley, NJ.",
